WEBVTT

00:08:28.837 --> 00:08:31.006
"Hm, I think this chair's
a little wobbly."

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.259
Now, I think we can all agree

00:08:33.259 --> 00:08:36.512
that the beauty and magic
of late-night is its timeliness.

00:08:36.929 --> 00:08:39.473
You know that no matter
what's happening in the world,

00:08:39.515 --> 00:08:42.476
you can turn on late-night television
and hear all about it.

00:08:42.935 --> 00:08:46.438
But when you shoot 96 episodes
in three months,

00:08:46.438 --> 00:08:48.148
you kind of lose that magic.

00:08:49.108 --> 00:08:55.030
I was the only show talking about
hooking up, partying, cuddling, traveling,

00:08:55.072 --> 00:08:58.951
in front of a live audience
during a literal global pandemic.

00:08:59.994 --> 00:09:01.495
Now, still, I thought,